<BaseLayout
  title="Leasing & Tenant Placement in North DFW | Diego Alvarado REALTOR®"
  description="Lease your North DFW home with Diego Alvarado, REALTOR® at Monument Realty: marketing, consistent screening, and a prepared lease. Hablo Español."
>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <h1>Leasing and Tenant Placement in North DFW</h1>
    <p>If you own a home in North DFW and want to rent it out, you and Diego will get it leased the right way: marketed well, screened consistently, and placed with a qualified tenant under a clear, signed lease. Diego Alvarado is a REALTOR® with Monument Realty, based in Flower Mound and working across the North DFW cities on this site.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container prose" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <p>This page is written first for property owners. This is a <strong>lease listing and tenant-placement</strong> service: you and Diego will market the property, screen applicants under fair-housing rules with the same written criteria applied to everyone, and prepare the lease. Once the lease is signed, the day-to-day running of the home stays with you. Diego does <strong>not</strong> offer ongoing property management.</p>
    <p>Call <a href="tel:+12148338911">(214) 833-8911</a> or <a href="/contact/">send a message</a>. <a href="/contacto/">Hablo Español</a>.</p>

    <h2>What you and Diego will do together</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Price the listing.</strong> You and Diego will look at comparable leased homes nearby, plus your home's condition and features, and set a rent that fits the market. This page does not state rents or fees.</li>
      <li><strong>Get the home ready.</strong> Diego will walk the home with you and point out the fixes and cleaning that help it show well.</li>
      <li><strong>Market the property.</strong> Your home is listed with good photos and a clear description so agents and renters can find it.</li>
      <li><strong>Handle showings and applications.</strong> Diego coordinates showings and collects applications.</li>
      <li><strong>Screen consistently.</strong> You and Diego will set written rental criteria before the listing goes live. Every applicant is measured against the same criteria, in the same way.</li>
      <li><strong>Prepare the lease.</strong> You and Diego will prepare the Texas lease forms, walk through the terms, and coordinate move-in once a qualified applicant is chosen.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>After the lease is signed</h2>
    <p>Day-to-day care of the home and the tenant relationship stays with you. Diego does <strong>not</strong> offer ongoing property management — no claim is made here about rent collection, maintenance, or managing the property after move-in.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Call or send a message.</strong> Tell Diego about the home and your timing.</li>
      <li><strong>Walk-through and listing plan.</strong> You and Diego will agree on the rent, the written criteria, and the marketing plan.</li>
      <li><strong>List and show.</strong> The home goes live and showings begin.</li>
      <li><strong>Choose a qualified applicant.</strong> You review applicants who meet the criteria you set.</li>
      <li><strong>Sign and hand over keys.</strong> The lease is prepared and signed, and the tenant moves in.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Where Diego leases homes</h2>
    <p>Lease listing and tenant placement are available in all of Diego's North DFW service cities:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/areas/flower-mound/">Flower Mound</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/coppell/">Coppell</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/grapevine/">Grapevine</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/trophy-club/">Trophy Club</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/highland-village/">Highland Village</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/lewisville/">Lewisville</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/roanoke/">Roanoke</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/argyle-lantana/">Argyle &amp; Lantana</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/bedford/">Bedford</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/euless/">Euless</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/double-oak/">Double Oak</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/copper-canyon/">Copper Canyon</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/bartonville/">Bartonville</a></li>
      <li><a href="/areas/northlake/">Northlake</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Looking for a rental?</h2>
    <p>This page is mainly for owners, but you and Diego can also help if you are relocating to North DFW or simply need help finding a rental. Tell Diego the commute, budget, and cities that matter, and you will tour with those priorities in mind. Start at <a href="/relocating/">Relocating to Flower Mound and North DFW</a>, or <a href="/contact/">contact Diego</a> directly. <a href="/contacto/">Hablo Español</a>.</p>

    <h2>Who this fits</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Homeowners in any of the <a href="/areas/">service cities</a> above who are moving but want to keep the home.</li>
      <li>Investors who own a rental in those cities and need a new tenant. See <a href="/investors/">how Diego works with investors</a>.</li>
      <li>Owners deciding between selling and renting. You and Diego can compare both options before you commit. For tax questions, talk with your CPA — Diego is not a tax advisor.</li>
      <li>Relocating clients and others who need help finding a rental.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Fair housing</h2>
    <p>Diego follows federal, Texas, and local fair housing laws. Every applicant is evaluated using the same written criteria, and no one is treated differently because of race, color, religion, sex, disability, familial status, national origin, or any other protected class. <strong>Equal Housing Opportunity.</strong></p>

    <h2>FAQs</h2>
    <p><strong>Do you manage the property after it's leased?</strong><br />
    No. Diego offers lease listing and tenant placement only: pricing the listing, marketing, showings, screening, and preparing the lease. After move-in, the ongoing care of the home and the tenant relationship stays with you. Diego does not offer ongoing property management.</p>
    <p><strong>Which cities do you lease homes in?</strong><br />
    All 14 of Diego's North DFW service cities: <a href="/areas/flower-mound/">Flower Mound</a>, <a href="/areas/coppell/">Coppell</a>, <a href="/areas/grapevine/">Grapevine</a>, <a href="/areas/trophy-club/">Trophy Club</a>, <a href="/areas/highland-village/">Highland Village</a>, <a href="/areas/lewisville/">Lewisville</a>, <a href="/areas/roanoke/">Roanoke</a>, <a href="/areas/argyle-lantana/">Argyle &amp; Lantana</a>, <a href="/areas/bedford/">Bedford</a>, <a href="/areas/euless/">Euless</a>, <a href="/areas/double-oak/">Double Oak</a>, <a href="/areas/copper-canyon/">Copper Canyon</a>, <a href="/areas/bartonville/">Bartonville</a>, and <a href="/areas/northlake/">Northlake</a>. If you are unsure whether a specific address fits, <a href="/contact/">contact Diego</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>How are applicants screened?</strong><br />
    You and Diego will set written rental criteria before the listing goes live, and every applicant is reviewed against the same criteria, in the same way, under fair housing rules.</p>
    <p><strong>Should I lease my home or sell it?</strong><br />
    That depends on your goals, your timing, and the numbers on your home. You and Diego will look at both paths. For tax questions, talk with your CPA. Diego is not a financial planner and does not give legal or tax advice.</p>
    <p><strong>Can you help me find a rental?</strong><br />
    Yes. Besides working with owners, you and Diego can help relocating clients and anyone who needs help finding a rental in the cities above. See <a href="/relocating/">Relocating to Flower Mound and North DFW</a>, or <a href="/contact/">start a conversation</a>.</p>

    <h2>Ready to lease your home?</h2>
    <p>Call Diego at <strong><a href="tel:+12148338911">(214) 833-8911</a></strong> or <a href="/contact/">send a message</a>. <a href="/contacto/">Hablo Español</a>.</p>
